excerpt: 'In this paper, we provide results about the nonwindowed scattering transform, which we formulate as the $q$ norm of a cascade of wavelet transforms and nonlinearities. The main result of this paper is a well-defined weighted measure with diffeomorphism stability properties akin to what is seen in the seminal paper, Group Invariant Scattering. Errata: On Generalizations of the Nonwindowed Scattering Transform
