E. Unaffected
The $q = 2$ energy identity, the $\mathbf{L}^q$ theory for $1 < q \le 2$, the dilation and diffeomorphism stability results for $1 < q \le 2$, and the rotation results for $q > 1$ are unchanged. The $q = 1$ results at one layer are unchanged.
